<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Quantum EPS raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Quantum EPS raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns analyst Andrew Neff said he reiterated his buy rating for Quantum Corp, raising his 1997 earnings estimate to $1.87 a share from $1.178 a share.</p>
<p>-- raised estimate for 1998 to $4.25 a share from $4.00.</p>
<p>-- said industry conditions in disk drive business are more favorable than investors recognize, given strong demand for high capacity drives.</p>
<p>-- said Quantum is well postioned with favorable new product cycles.</p>
</text>
